"), and tabs ("\\\\tfull\\\\t")\n   - Verifies all whitespace variations are 
correctly recognized as "full"\n\n## Verification\n- All existing tests pass (46
tests)\n- New test passes, confirming the fix works\n- Code coverage remains at 
